 <p style="font-size:var(--text-body-sm);color:var(--color-body);line-height:1.65;margin:0;">
 Saving Reels for offline viewing, keeping a favorite clip, or personal reference -- that falls under personal use and is broadly tolerated. Instagram's Terms of Service technically prohibit downloading outside the app, but that clause targets automated bots scraping entire libraries, not a person saving one Reel. The legal reality is more nuanced than the ToS text suggests.
 </p>
