 <p style="font-size:var(--text-body-sm);color:var(--color-body);line-height:1.65;margin:0;">
 Using a downloaded Reel in an ad, a YouTube compilation, a podcast, or any monetized content requires explicit permission from the original creator. Copyright applies to the video itself, not just the audio. Get written permission or risk a takedown.
 </p>
